ーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブまでも残り少ないし\n年末に向けていろいろなことがあるから\nがんばらなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスケーキどんなのにしようかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、車の中で花奈さんが\nクリスマスケーキを注文していて\n私もしないと！って思ってたのに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れてた。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなのしようかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもは自分で選ばなけど\n今年は選んでみようかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳だからねっ！大人だからねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/29/2717461/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/29/2717461/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前にふざけてたの3人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張をほぐすためだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/29/2717461/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみなさいっ！"}],"source":"archive"}